on a Friday night at 7:00.

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:38.534
You know. So, like, you know,
I would play games.

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:40.467
Like, I would make up names
for myself.

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:42.701
And sometimes,
I would be, like, Trevor.

00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:45.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:47.133
-"Trevor" was your character?
