in full character, like,

00:02:56.501 --> 00:02:58.567
"Hi. My name's Trevor"?
-Yeah, "Hi. My name's Trevor.

00:02:58.567 --> 00:03:00.834
Can I start you off with a
coffee, water, Pepsi product?

00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:02.534
